{"id": "R-SAGA-1", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "design", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "Every saga beat carries at least one locator, and every locator resolves to an existing record, path section or PR", "authored_by": "claude:anamnesis#wake-20261111-03", "rationale": "Proposed in docs/design/saga.md for HO-ANA-20261111-WZ0B (DEC-205); not accepted by Zach", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P0@2"}]}
{"id": "R-SAGA-2", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "design", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "The saga is a navigation layer only: it is never cited as evidence; answers cite the records its beats point to", "authored_by": "claude:anamnesis#wake-20261111-03", "rationale": "Proposed in docs/design/saga.md for HO-ANA-20261111-WZ0B (DEC-205); not accepted by Zach", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P0@2"}]}
{"id": "R-SAGA-3", "version": 1, "type": "requirement", "subject": "design", "epistemic": "provisional", "text": "A closed saga chapter changes only by appended revision lines that name the record causing the change, using the claim-delta operations", "authored_by": "claude:anamnesis#wake-20261111-03", "rationale": "Proposed in docs/design/saga.md for HO-ANA-20261111-WZ0B (DEC-205); not accepted by Zach", "relations": [{"rel": "serves", "to": "P0@2"}]}
